Semu's macOS launch transition. RetroArch entered fullscreen with a native
fullscreen Space: its 480x360 nib window appeared first, then macOS slid to
a black Space while the window grew. The frontend (ES-DE) is a borderless
window on the desktop Space, so fullscreen here is the same: a borderless
window covering the chosen screen, Dock and menu bar hidden. The window stays
transparent until its first frame is presented, then fades in over the
frontend beneath it.

